  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capital Markets Development Trust Fund by AfDB (CMDTF) 2024-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Capital Markets Development Trust Fund by AfDB (CMDTF) 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r CMDTF &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja etableringen av v&#xe4;lfungerande kapitalmarknader i Afrika som effektivt mobiliserar och allokerar resurser f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;ta den privata och offentliga sektorns finansieringsbehov. F&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; detta m&#xe5;l planerar CMDTF att:

i) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kapitalmarknadernas regelverk och juridiska milj&#xf6;;

ii) Uppgradera kapitalmarknadernas infrastruktur;

iii) Diversifiera tillg&#xe4;ngliga produkter;

iv) Bredda investerarbasen; och,

v) &#xd6;ka kunskapen om de afrikanska kapitalmarknaderna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the CMDTF is to promote the establishment of well-functioning capital markets in Africa that effectively mobilize and allocate resources to meet the financing needs of the private and public sectors. To achieve this goal, the CMDTF plans to:

i) Improve the regulatory and legal environment of capital markets;

(ii) upgrading the infrastructure of capital markets

(iii) diversify available products

(iv) broaden the investor base; and

v) Increase knowledge of African capital markets.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Capital Markets Development Trust Fund (CMDTF) is to promote the establishment of well-functioning capital markets in Africa that effectively mobilize and allocate resources to meet the financing needs of the private and public sectors. To achieve this goal, the CMDTF plans to:

i) Improve the regulatory and legal environment of capital markets;

(ii) upgrading the infrastructure of capital markets;

(iii) diversify available products;

(iv) broaden the investor base; and,

v) Increase knowledge of African capital markets.</narrative>
  </description>
